---
description: localshare v1 invariants — Tailscale Serve/Funnel wrapper, YAML intent file, tailnet-first
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` in this repo.

- `localshare.yaml` is the shareability flag and the source of intent.
- Default reach is Tailscale Serve (tailnet). Funnel requires `allow.public: true` and `localshare up --public --yes`.
- Do not implement LAN/mDNS or Tailscale Services in v1.
- Do not call `tailscale serve` / `funnel` except through this CLI (or tests with a fake runner).
- Keep the compile step a thin argv translation. No extra data plane.
